   "text": "COMPOSES DOWN ONLY\n\nPack.summary_text() pushes\ncontext INTO the prompt.\n\nNothing walks back UP to\nre-derive a parent's purpose.\n\nTestStep carrying no pointer\npast scenario_id is CORRECT \u2014\nthe scenario is the unit.",
