   "type": "text",
   "text": "REALITY \u2014 a delivery channel\n\nrefocus.cjs re-injects the leaf->root trace\nat the seat's next turn boundary.\n\nThe CHECK is three self-asked questions.",
   "originalText": "REALITY \u2014 a delivery channel\n\nrefocus.cjs re-injects the leaf->root trace\nat the seat's next turn boundary.\n\nThe CHECK is three self-asked questions.",
   "fontSize": 14,
