   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "text": "A running seat read its configuration at session start, and nothing in its context\nre-reads disk on its own. That premise is true of OUR resumable paths too \u2014\nRoundSession._rehydrate restores questions and decisions, never plan-brief.md.",
   "originalText": "A running seat read its configuration at session start, and nothing in its context\nre-reads disk on its own. That premise is true of OUR resumable paths too \u2014\nRoundSession._rehydrate restores questions and decisions, never plan-brief.md.",
